    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/statista/project-manager-hamburg-195997> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-projektmanager-online-marketing-berlin-429206> a prov:Entity,
