    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">About Baringa&nbsp;</span></h3> <p>Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.</p> <p>The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.</p> <p>Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.</p> <p>Certified as a&nbsp;<em>Great Place to Work </em>around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the <em>Financial Times </em>in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by <em>Forbes </em>for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.</p></div><h2><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">Our Organisational, Effectiveness &amp; Agility practice are looking for an experienced Senior Manager or Director to join the team.</span>&nbsp;</span></h2> <p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">We are experts who put people first to transform organisations through future-ready operating models, agile ways of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">working, and enterprise transformation. We help our clients build more adaptive, effective, and sustainable organisations by shaping how people, processes, and emerging technologies come together. This&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">expertise</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">spans&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">multiple industries, reflecting our current cross-industry approach. However, we are now prioritising deep industry specialisation</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">, particularly&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">in&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">Financial Services and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">Consumer Products</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">Retail</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">.</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">&nbsp;Our experts</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW46554368 BCX8\">&nbsp;partner closely with our industry-focused colleagues and go to market together.</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW46554368 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></p> <h3><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 53, 142);\"><span data-contrast=\"none\">What you will be doing</span></span></h3> <p><span data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:2,&quot;335559685&quot;:1320,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">Our roles are about helping clients redesign and deliver the organisations of the future</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">by shaping operating models that enable agility,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">human-centred&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">design</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">&nbsp;and efficiency</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">As a Senior Manager, you will play a leading role in setting direction, shap</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">ing client&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">engagements</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">&nbsp;and driving enterprise-wide transformation,</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW236546642 BCX8\">&nbsp;translating strategic priorities into practical structures, processes, and governance frameworks that drive sustainable impact.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW236546642 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p> <ul> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">Enterprise</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">-</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">w</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">ide Operating Model Design and Implementation</span></span></strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">:&nbsp;</span></strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">Leading the definition</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">&nbsp;and&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">implementation of</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">&nbsp;target operating models, organisational structures and governance frameworks</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">&nbsp;that align to strategic priorities and enable agility</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW70950268 BCX8\">&nbsp;across complex organisations.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW70950268 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">Cost</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">&amp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">P</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">roductivity&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">O</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">ptimisation</span></strong><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\"><strong>:</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">Shaping and leading large-scale redesign of</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">&nbsp;operating models to&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">improve efficiency, redu</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">c</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">e costs and unlock long-term value through streamlines processes and resource allocation</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW111167043 BCX8\">.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW111167043 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\"><strong>Integration &amp; Capability Build:</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">Leading</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">&nbsp;complex organisational transitions, such as mergers,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">acquisitions</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">&nbsp;or new business units, by designing and embedding capabilities that&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">enable smooth integration and operational&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">effectiveness</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW202228183 BCX8\">.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW202228183 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\"><strong>Ways of Working &amp; Agility:</strong>&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"TextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\">Setting direction for how organisations evolve</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\">&nbsp;processes, decision-making, and funding models to foster collaboration,&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\">innovation</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW258400476 BCX8\">&nbsp;and responsiveness at scale.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW258400476 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW258400476 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW32157730 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW32157730 BCX8\">AI-Enabled Operating Model Transformation</span></span></strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW32157730 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW32157730 BCX8\"><strong>:</strong> Designing future-fit organisations that can embed and scale AI - with the right structures, accountabilities, and cultural foundations </span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW32157730 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW258400476 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">Dat</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">a</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">-Driven Insights:&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">Overseeing the application of analytics and diagnostic</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">&nbsp;tools (e.g.&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW242487926 BCX8\">OrgVue</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">) to assess spans</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">, layers, costs, and workforce performance, translating insights into&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW242487926 BCX8\">strategic recommendations and executive decisions.</span></span><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW242487926 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\">&nbsp;</span></span></li> <li style=\"line-height: 2;\" data-leveltext=\"\" data-font=\"Symbol\" data-listid=\"34\" data-list-defn-props=\"{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}\" data-aria-posinset=\"2\" data-aria-level=\"1\"><span class=\"EOP Selected SCXW258400476 BCX8\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}\"><strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW29163897 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW29163897 BCX8\">Client Leadership &amp; Business Development:</span></span></strong><span class=\"TextRun SCXW29163897 BCX8\" lang=\"EN-GB\" data-contrast=\"none\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW29163897 BCX8\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>B