    schema:description "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">At Ripple, we’re building a world where value moves like information does today. It’s big, it’s bold, and we’re already doing it. Through our crypto solutions for financial institutions, businesses, governments and developers, we are improving the global financial system and creating greater economic fairness and opportunity for more people, in more places around the world. And we get to do the best work of our career and grow our skills surrounded by colleagues who have our backs.&nbsp;</span></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.</span></p></div><div> <p><strong>THE WORK:</strong></p> <p>Ripple is growing, and we're looking to hire an experienced Senior Sales Manager, based in London to cover the German and Austrian markets. This sales quota-carrying position is responsible for revenue generation through the direct sale of Ripple Products, including Custody, Payments and Stablecoin, to crypto natives and FinTechs. The ideal candidate lives and breathes customer centricity, is a sales hunter and has a passion for the digital asset industry.</p> <p>If you’re ready to see your impact and unlock incredible career growth opportunities, join us, and build real world value.</p> <p><strong>WHAT YOU’LL DO:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Demonstrate extensive knowledge of Ripple products, including Custody, Stablecoin and Payments, effectively communicating the value propositions to Financial Institutions and Crypto-Natives.</li> <li>Generate leads and secure sales bookings for Ripple products in Germany and Austria to achieve assigned sales quotas.</li> <li>Develop strategic plans and account tactics, guided by management, to nurture leads and foster relationships within assigned territories and accounts.</li> <li>Conduct client site visits, deliver sales presentations, and perform product demonstrations to prospective clients, driving engagement and interest.</li> <li>Facilitate the smooth progression of leads through the sales process, including prospect qualification, needs assessment, solution presentation, and timely closure of deals.</li> <li>Maintain accurate and up-to-date sales pipeline forecasts daily, ensuring timely and detailed reporting of sales activities and outcomes.</li> <li>German speaking is a must</li> </ul> </div> <div> <p><strong>WHAT YOU'LL BRING:&nbsp;</strong></p> <ul> <li>Bachelor’s degree preferred</li> <li>8+ years experience in a consultative sales role in technology and/or Financial Services industry.</li> <li>3+ years of experience in the Digital Assets and/or payments industry or a related field.</li> <li>Must have a proven track record of successful sales to Crypto-Natives and FinTechs.</li> <li>Extensive relationships and strong knowledge within the Financial Services and Digital Asset industry in Europe</li> <li>Ability and desire to manage a territory independently</li> <li>German speaking a must.</li> <li>Exceptional attention to detail and a proactive, collaborative approach.</li> <li>Strong knowledge of Salesforce and other relevant industry tools.</li> </ul> </div><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><hr> <p><strong>WHO WE ARE:</strong></p> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do Your Best Work</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The opportunity to build in a fast-paced start-up environment with experienced industry leaders</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A learning environment where you can dive deep into the latest technologies and make an impact.&nbsp; A professional development budget to support other modes of learning.</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Thrive in an environment where no matter what race, ethnicity, gender, origin, or culture they identify with, every employee is a respected, valued, and empowered part of the team.</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In-office collaboration for moments that matter is important to our culture, and we give managers and teams the flexibility to decide which 10+ days a month they come in.&nbsp;</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bi-weekly all-company meeting - business updates and ask me anything style discussion with our Leadership Team</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We come together for moments that matter which include team offsites, team bonding activities, happy hours and more!</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take Control of Your Finances</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Competitive salary, bonuses, and equity</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Competitive benefits that cover physical and mental healthcare, retirement, family forming, and family support</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Employee giving match</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mobile phone stipend</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Take Care of Yourself</span></p> <ul> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">R&amp;R days so you can rest and recharge</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Generous wellness reimbursement and weekly onsite &amp; virtual programming</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Generous vacation policy - work with your manager to take time off when you need it</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Industry-leading parental leave policies. Family planning benefits.</span></li> <li style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Catered lunches, fully-stocked kitchens with premium snacks/beverages, and plenty of fun events</span></li> </ul> <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><em data-stringify-type=\"italic\">Benefits listed above are for full-time employees.&nbsp;</em></span></p> <hr> <div><em>Ripple is an Equal Opportunity Employer. We’re committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We do not discriminate against qualified employees or applicants because of race, color, religion, gender identity, sex, sexual identity, pregnancy, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, marital status, physical disability, mental disability, medical condition, military status, or any other characteristic protected by local law or ordinance.</em></div> <div>&nbsp;</div> <div><em>Please find our <a href=\"https://ripple.com/legal/eu-privacy-notice/\" target=\"_blank\">UK/EU Applicant Privacy Notice </a>and our <a href=\"https://ripple.com/legal/ca-applicant-privacy-notice/\" target=\"_blank\">California Applicant Privacy Notice</a> for reference.</em></div> <div><hr></div></div> Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow" ;
    schema:hiringOrganization kgjd:employer-ripple ;
