    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/jobs/companies/bjak/talent-acquisition-executive-london-488109> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-talent-acquisition-praktikum-berlin-79626> a prov:Entity,
