    schema:title "Video Content Creator (m/w/d)" ;
    schema:url <https://www.arbeitnow.com/jobs/companies/memodo/video-content-creator-munich-143210> .

<https://openknowledgegraphs.com/prototypes/kg-jobs/live/job/arbeitnow-waste-collector-soho-farmhouse-soho-farmhouse-chipping-norton-114364> a prov:Entity,
